  "description": "The Oxva VPrime Pod Kit is designed for vapers seeking both power and versatility. With its hefty 2600mAh built-in battery and up to 60W max output, this compact yet robust pod kit delivers exceptional performance across multiple vaping styles, from MTL (mouth-to-lung) to DTL (direct-to-lung). Equipped with Oxva’s advanced VPrime pods, this kit supports an easy top-fill system and comes with two pre-installed mesh pods: a 0.2ohm option for larger vapour production and a 0.4ohm option for a more restricted RDTL draw. These pods provide incredible flavour and vibrant vapour thanks to the built-in mesh coil technology, designed to heat e-liquid more efficiently for a rich and consistent vape. Smart Mode automatically detects the best wattage for your installed pod, ensuring an effortless and optimised vaping experience. You can further customise your vape with adjustable airflow, giving you control over your draw tightness or looseness. Additionally, the 0.96-inch 3D display provides clear, real-time information on battery life, puff count, and wattage settings. Combined with fast USB Type-C charging, the Oxva VPrime is the perfect everyday companion for vapers on the go. Explore our vape juice and discover the perfect flavour for your device. We recommend using high VG (sub-Ohm) E-liquid with this kit. Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
